      "body": "When we select an item in the left-hand mapping bar, we should pan the map so that the feature is in the centre.\r\n\r\n**Improvement:** when an item is double-clicked in the mapping bar pan to it.  Don't pan if it is just being selected.\r\n\r\nSince the `onselect` method in the mapping component only receives and id (and not the element itself) I _guess_ we could add an optional `point` to the `onSelect` method in the Mapping component.\r\n\r\nThe left-hand bar would create a shape for the feature, ask `turf` to provide the centre of that shape, and pass that.",
